# Raven Oracle Web Frontend Environment Variables

# API Base URL - Full URL to the Raven Oracle API backend
# Development: http://localhost:4000/api (default if not set)
# Production AWS: https://api.ravenoracle.com/api (or your actual AWS domain)
# 
# IMPORTANT: This MUST be set at build time for Next.js production builds
# Next.js bundles NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables into the frontend JavaScript at build time.
# 
# For local development, you can omit this or set it to:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:4000/api"
#
# For AWS production deployment, set before building:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="https://api.ravenoracle.com/api"
#
# Example production build workflow:
# export NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="https://api.ravenoracle.com/api"
# npm run build
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:4000/api"
